    "updated_at": "2022-02-16T18:24:46Z",
    "body": "Konsole is known to have issues with correctly dealing with unicode, see [the examples here](https://eev.ee/blog/2015/09/12/dark-corners-of-unicode/) for one showcase.\r\n\r\nI'd say to file this as upstream, but unfortunately, given that many of these issues have existed for 10+ years, you might be better off changing the symbol, or using a different terminal emulator if having the unicode symbol is important to you.",
