    "created_at": "2022-12-28T12:31:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-28T12:31:13Z",
    "body": "Closing this as it seems to be a problem with konsole rather than starship, as a work around I have found adding an extra whitespace as padding can help in these situations. Something like\n```toml \n[conda]\nformat = \"via [$symbol $environment]($style) \"\n\n# or\n\n[conda]\nformat = \"via [$symbol $environment ]($style) \"\n```\n\nDepending on your set up. \n",
